.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2156/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2156/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2156/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Lulus.jpg","#000000",[51],{"name":19,"slug":20,"headline":21,"logo":52,"transparentLogo":53,"logoBackground":54,"colorFill":49},{"id":23,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":24,"assetUrlXs":25,"assetUrlSm":26,"assetUrlMd":27,"assetUrlLg":28,"assetUrlXl":29,"assetUrlXxl":30},{"id":32,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":33,"assetUrlXs":34,"assetUrlSm":35,"assetUrlMd":36,"assetUrlLg":37,"assetUrlXl":38,"assetUrlXxl":39},{"id":41,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":42,"assetUrlXs":43,"assetUrlSm":44,"assetUrlMd":45,"assetUrlLg":46,"assetUrlXl":47,"assetUrlXxl":48},{"contentTopicImage":56,"name":58,"slug":59},{"id":57,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2429","Announcements","announcement",false,"2021-11-11","From #lovelulus To LVLU… Lulus Goes Public! | IVP",{"id":64,"alt":7,"caption":7,"assetUrl":8,"assetUrlXs":8,"assetUrlSm":8,"assetUrlMd":8,"assetUrlLg":8,"assetUrlXl":8,"assetUrlXxl":8},"2521",[66,79,83,95],{"instance":67},{"__typename":68,"heading":8,"image":69},"FullImage",{"id":70,"alt":71,"caption":7,"assetUrl":72,"assetUrlXs":73,"assetUrlSm":74,"assetUrlMd":75,"assetUrlLg":76,"assetUrlXl":77,"assetUrlXxl":78},"800","Pink dresses hung up with Lulu's tags","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/xs_IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/sm_IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/md_IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/lg_IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/xl_IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/800/xxl_IVP_portfolio_LVLU_post-768x403.png",{"instance":80},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":8,"heading":8,"body":82},"TextBlock","Today we are honored to congratulate the fashionable and amazing team at [Lulus](https://www.lulus.com/) on a successful IPO. This marks the 129th IPO for IVP and 14th in 2021.\r\n\r\nLulus is a widely popular women’s brand because it is extremely customer-driven and digitally native. Lulus offers its customers affordable luxury fashion through curated, exclusive products, great customer service and a highly personalized shopping experience.\r\n\r\n**Surprising and Delighting Millions of Customers**\r\n\r\nIn April 2018, IVP led Lulus’ $120 million Series A, the company’s first outside fundraising since H.I.G. Growth’s majority investment in 2014. [At the time](https://www.ivp.com/news/blog/coming-into-fashion/), Lulus was – and remains – at the center of two key e-commerce trends that are very exciting to IVP: the rise of digitally-native brands and data-driven merchandising and design. Lulus has capitalized on those trends and transformed its humble beginnings as a vintage clothing store founded in Chico, CA in 1996 into a beloved brand powering a company driving nine-figures in revenue and equally impressively, significant profitability.\r\n\r\nBy primarily focusing on selling their own branded products, Lulus has become one of the best online shopping experiences for millennial and Gen Z women today. Lulus has earned 7.5 million followers on social media who interact one on one with personal style advisors, fit experts and even a bridal concierge. Customer growth by word of mouth is also off the charts. Today, Lulus has 2.5 million active and loyal customers – 94% of its reorder products are sold without moving to sale pricing and 65% of its sales are from repeat customers. It is no wonder why so many millennial and GenZ women simply “#lovelulus!”.\r\n\r\n**Staying Connected to and Supporting Its Customers**\r\n\r\nAlthough the company was impacted by the pandemic in 2020, Lulus benefited from its strong following and online presence; 58% of Gen Z consumers say they are online almost constantly which is where Lulus operates as a digitally-native brand. Lulus goes beyond customer experiences and social presence – it also actively supports its demographic, having created an endowment to foster higher education and empower women in all aspects of life back as far as 2013.\r\n\r\n**The Next Chapter – A Public Company!**",{"instance":84},{"__typename":68,"heading":8,"image":85},{"id":86,"alt":87,"caption":7,"assetUrl":88,"assetUrlXs":89,"assetUrlSm":90,"assetUrlMd":91,"assetUrlLg":92,"assetUrlXl":93,"assetUrlXxl":94},"801","Lulu's team as Nasdaq opening bell","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/xs_Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/sm_Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/md_Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/lg_Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/xl_Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/801/xxl_Lulus-Team_IVP--768x512.jpg",{"instance":96},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":8,"heading":8,"body":8},{"id":98,"assetUrl":8},"560",{"assetUrl":8},[],"from-lovelulus-to-lvlu-lulus-goes-public",[103,126],{"fullName":104,"teamSubcategories":105,"slug":112,"image":113,"abbreviatedTitle":122,"focusAreas":123,"emailAddress":124,"bio":125},"Jules Maltz",[106],{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":109},"Apps","apps",{"name":110,"slug":111},"Investors","investors","jules-maltz",{"id":114,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":115,"assetUrlXs":116,"assetUrlSm":117,"assetUrlMd":118,"assetUrlLg":119,"assetUrlXl":120,"assetUrlXxl":121},"2363","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2363/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Jules_Maltz.jpg","Venture Partner","Productivity Software, Enterprise SaaS, Internet Technology","jules@ivp.com","I was surprised to find myself back in venture after graduate school. I love working closely with entrepreneurs, so I had fully expected to join a startup where I could play a critical role in helping a company grow from the start. But IVP presented the opportunity to do that at scale across multiple companies, and I realized that’s what I was searching for: the chance to help founders with incredible ideas make an impact in the world. I joined IVP in 2008 and never looked back.\r\n\r\nTechnology changes so rapidly that today’s enterprise and software products differ vastly from those that emerged just a few years ago. The companies that really take hold are those with a clear mission and an understanding of why their product needs to exist—the problem it will solve and the people it will help. \r\n\r\nIt never gets old to work with entrepreneurs from the ground up. Whenever I meet a founder for the first time, I enter the meeting with genuine excitement: this next company could be the one—the one to improve people’s lives, to build a new category, to fundamentally change the world. It’s an honor to listen to their ideas and work with them to fulfill their dreams.",{"fullName":127,"teamSubcategories":128,"slug":147,"image":148,"abbreviatedTitle":157,"focusAreas":158,"emailAddress":159,"bio":160},"Eric Liaw",[129,133,135,139,143],{"name":130,"slug":131,"teamCategory":132},"All","investors-all",{"name":110,"slug":111},{"name":107,"slug":108,"teamCategory":134},{"name":110,"slug":111},{"name":136,"slug":137,"teamCategory":138},"Consumer","consumer",{"name":110,"slug":111},{"name":140,"slug":141,"teamCategory":142},"Digital Health","digital-health",{"name":110,"slug":111},{"name":144,"slug":145,"teamCategory":146},"Fintech & Crypto","fintech-crypto",{"name":110,"slug":111},"eric-liaw",{"id":149,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":150,"assetUrlXs":151,"assetUrlSm":152,"assetUrlMd":153,"assetUrlLg":154,"assetUrlXl":155,"assetUrlXxl":156},"2353","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","General Partner","Enterprise Software, Gaming & AR2, Bottom-Up Solutions, Consumer, FinTech","eliaw@ivp.com","I came to IVP not only for what we do but how we do it. We partner with entrepreneurs right as they approach an inflection point—the moment when identifying and equipping an organization with the right ingredients can make an astronomical difference in its trajectory. Together, we’re able to shape the future of high-growth startups and, as a result, the future of our world.\r\n\r\nIt’s a true privilege to work with entrepreneurs and founders who are pushing the envelope to solve pressing issues that serve their customers. Supporting those founders with hard work is its own reward. My commitment to entrepreneurs is to be available whenever they need me.",{"id":162,"alt":7,"caption":8,"assetUrl":163,"assetUrlXs":164,"assetUrlSm":165,"assetUrlMd":166,"assetUrlLg":167,"assetUrlXl":168,"assetUrlXxl":169},"797","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/xs_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/sm_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/md_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/lg_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/xl_Lulus.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/797/xxl_Lulus.jpg","From #lovelulus To LVLU… Lulus Goes Public!",1790351934751]